{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1553693-appreciation-rant-and-an-offer","id":1553693,"title":"appreciation, rant and an offer","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-09-08T14:35:58-07:00","id":1553693,"title":"appreciation, rant and an offer","content":"Hi everyone, this is my first post in this forum. I know this system was discontinued a couple of years ago, and the forum is a bit... ehm... let's say a Moros would like it in here. Anyhow, I came back to DM this system after a long hiatus, I had been playing with my friends for a year now. First of all some appreciation, I had been using a lot of the resources in this forum to make my campaign, particulary the lists made by <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/775-reighnhell\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar775_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"775\" data-vbnamecard=\"775\">Reighnhell</a>, the legacies updated by <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12619_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12619\" data-vbnamecard=\"12619\">21C Hermit</a> and I had a blast reading the Dimensions Unseen writeup made by <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27424-phoog\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar27424_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"27424\" data-vbnamecard=\"27424\">Phoog</a>, so thank all users who posted here and helped me DMing this. Second, a bit of venting... I love this system, it is so mechanically interesting and the overreaching lore is so cool, but gosh it hates people trying to play it. I had beeen suffering for a year and something now to organize all the info in a way that actually makes sense and allows me to know what Im doing, and I have my doubts I succeded.<br /> Anyhow, is anyone interested in me posting a writeup of my campaign, and some of the resources I created? I ask cause I don't want to use my energy if noone is going to read it, but if someone is interested I might give it a try.<br /> Cheers!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28905-keeperofthedarkhound","name":"KeeperoftheDarkHound","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28905_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-08T16:39:36-07:00","id":1553695,"title":"","content":"I can assure you that you'll have readers, even if they don't engage in posting.<br /> <br /> A lot of people read here, and chronicle write-ups are popular, so be welcome!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-08T20:34:12-07:00","id":1553698,"title":"","content":"I second that, I am always looking forward to reading more actual plays.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the f